  "title": "ESS Named One of TIME and Statista’s World’s Top GreenTech Companies in 2026 for the Second Consecutive Year",
  "summary": "ESS Tech, Inc. (NYSE: GWH) (\"ESS\" or the \"company\"), a leading provider of safer, non-lithium energy storage solutions, today announced that it has been named one of TIME and Statista's World's Top GreenTech Companies 2026, marking the second consecutive year ESS has earned recognition on the prestigious list following its inclusion in 2025.",
